_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are still economy seats available on the banana shaped rocket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/4311a15b9c2fdfb65ebbe79c32db5737.avif?t=1745506254\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Bonkies is a physics-based, couch co-op party game where you and up to 3 of your prime mates equip banana-fuelled jetpacks and robo-arms, and frantically try to raise wacky buildings all over the cosmos for the glory of apekind! Become the CHIMPion of space construction!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cWe laughed, we cried, we conquered!\u201d<br>9 \u2013 Techraptor<br><br>\u201cA demanding co-op experience that requires solid teamwork!\u201d<br>8 \u2013 The Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201cWith hilarious dialogue and world details, and a variety of fun mechanics and pleasant physics, the sum of all these parts helps to build an absolutely delightful experience.\u201d<br>8 \u2013 Indie Game Website<br>",
